		"description": "<p>Bone and sinew obey your command and grow a set of teeth in one of your palms. Flinging your arm out, forcefully, you launch the bony projectiles into your opponents. Choose a number of targets up to your proficiency bonus in a 15ft cone. Each must make a Constitution save or take Basic Melee necrotic damage and lose the ability to act on initiative counts other than their own until the start of their next turn. On a successful save, the target is [[/condition id=rattled]] until the start of their next turn.</p>",
